[[1,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2891223\">1032B44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891200\">1020A20</a></p><p>1. Undo the retaining bolt.</p><p>2. Withdraw the rpm sensor from its seat, open the retaining collar\nand place to one side.</p><p>3. Undo the bolts securing the cover to the engine block.</p><p>4. Remove the front cover and recover the seal.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2033896.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Replace the seal on the engine block.</p><p>1. Remove sealing ring  (1a) from the front cover by inserting a\ndrift into groove (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2033897.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,63,0,"<p>Fit the front cover to the engine block.</p><p>Tighten the fixing bolts to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>CRANKSHAFT FRONT COVER</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.7</p></td></tr></table></div><p>1. Use tool (1a) to fit  new oil sealing ring (1b) in place.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Fitting tool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.878.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2033898.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,63,0,"<p><a href=\"#/2891200\">1020A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891223\">1032B44</a></p>"]]